                                "sense_id": "30584312-9bf0-353c-897e-eee75cfb1e31",
                                "text": "In 1992, at the age of eighty-eight, Deng visited the Shenzhen and Zhuhai Special Economic Zones in order to defend his policies against Party critics."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2df29148-2383-4685-ba75-e2eb4351e56d",
                                "sense_id": "30584312-9bf0-353c-897e-eee75cfb1e31",
                                "text": "Super typhoon Saola made landfall in southeast China’s Guangdong province early Saturday, leaving a trail of destruction and flooding in Shenzhen city and the neighboring Hong Kong and Macao.\nThe typhoon made landfall around 3:30 am south of the city of Zhuhai, located along the coast of Guangdong, the National Meteorological Center said."
                            }
                        ]
